# X on a bubble: the sheet of verbs about that one message, and the delete on the end of it.
#
# The thread's four face buttons were already spoken for - A replies, X reacts, Y writes, B backs
# out - so the delete lives on the sheet X already raises rather than on a fifth key that would
# have done nothing on most rows. It is the last row so the cursor never opens on it, it takes
# two presses like the conversation list's delete, and B stands the arming down without closing
# the sheet.
#
# Nothing is deleted here: the capture harness has no app behind it, so the clip stops where the
# row raises the question.

scene demo
tab messages

# Open the direct conversation with Bravo Creek and raise the sheet on the bubble.
key down 4
key a
hold 700
key x
hold 900

# Down past the eight emoji to the delete.
key down 8
hold 900

# One press arms it and the row itself says so; B stands it back down.
key a
hold 1400
key b
hold 900
